 "questions": [
  {
   "id": 666487,
   "is_answer_order_important": false,
   "stimulus_html": "",
   "stem_html": "What is the output of the following code?\n<pre class=\"python\" data-lang=\"python\">i = 1\n\nwhile i &lt;= 2:\n&nbsp;&nbsp;j = 1\n&nbsp;&nbsp;while j &lt;= 3:\n&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;print('*', end = '')\n&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;j += 1\n&nbsp;&nbsp;print()\n&nbsp;&nbsp;i += 1\n</pre>\n",
   "answers": [
    {
     "id": 1328514,
     "content_html": "<pre class=\"python\" data-lang=\"python\">******\n</pre>\n",
     "correctness": "0.0",
     "feedback_html": "At the end of each outer loop's iteration, a new line is printed. Since the outer loop executes twice, the output must have two lines."
    },
    {
     "id": 1328515,
     "content_html": "<pre class=\"python\" data-lang=\"python\">***\n***\n</pre>\n",
     "correctness": "1.0",
     "feedback_html": "Each inner loop's full execution prints three \"*\" characters, and the outer loop executes twice."
    },
    {
     "id": 1328516,
     "content_html": "<pre class=\"python\" data-lang=\"python\">**\n**\n**\n</pre>\n",
     "correctness": "0.0",
     "feedback_html": "The print statement in the inner loop does not print a new line and all <code class=\"python\" data-lang=\"python\">'*'</code> characters are printed in one line for an inner loop's full execution. Since the inner loop executes for <code class=\"python\" data-lang=\"python\">j =</code> 1, 2, and 3, each output line must have three <code class=\"python\" data-lang=\"python\">'*'</code> characters. How many lines of output does the code print?"
    }
   ],
